    "longDescription": "Genspark is an AI workspace that helps you research, write, create, and organize work from simple prompts.\n\nYou can use Genspark for tasks such as answering questions, creating presentations, working with spreadsheets, drafting documents, building software projects, generating meeting notes, and creating images, videos, or audio.\n\nSUPER AGENT\n• Ask questions and get AI-assisted answers\n• Research topics and collect useful information\n• Create images, videos, and audio from prompts\n\nAI SLIDES\n• Create presentation drafts from prompts\n• Add researched content to support your slides\n\nAI SHEETS\n• Collect information and create spreadsheet templates\n• Turn raw information into structured tables and summaries\n\nAI DOCS\n• Draft documents from prompts\n• Use templates for common writing and planning tasks\n\nAI DEVELOPER\n• Create website, app, and game project drafts\n• Connect with GitHub workflows for code editing and pull requests\n\nAI MEETING NOTES\n• Transcribe meetings\n• Generate and share meeting notes with participants\n\nAI CHAT\n• Chat with supported AI models such as GPT, Claude, Gemini, and Grok\n\nAI IMAGE\n• Create images with supported image generation models\n\nAI VIDEO\n• Create videos with supported video generation models\n\nGenspark also includes tools such as AI Designer, Photo Genius, Clip Genius, AI Pods, and Deep Research to help with different creative and productivity workflows.\n\nTerms of Service: https://mainfunc.ai/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://mainfunc.ai/privacy",
